OL,3,GNEWSAPier mistress' memoir tells of boy
OL,4,Abands, bombs and Emma Thompson
OL,5,
OL,6,FStories about a One Direction music
OL,7,Fvideo, actor Emma Thompson and a bomb
OL,8,Fdisposal team all feature in a woman's
OL,9,Fmemoir about her time running England's
OL,10,Fonly Grade I-listed pier.
OL,12,FLinda Strong was pier mistress, or
OL,13,Fmanager, at Clevedon Pier, North
OL,14,FSomerset, from 2005 to 2015, and her
OL,15,Fnew book Tales of a Pier Mistress -
OL,16,FBombs, Bands and Bumps in the Night
OL,17,Ftells some of the zanier incidents
OL,18,Fduring her time in charge.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
