OL,3,GNEWSAPier mistress' memoir tells of boy
OL,4,Abands, bombs and Emma Thompson
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong was the only staff member who
OL,7,Fknew One Direction were coming to film
OL,8,Fthe video for You & I in 2014 and was
OL,9,Fsworn to secrecy because there were
OL,10,Fconcerns fans would turn up in large
OL,11,Fnumbers from across the country and
OL,12,Fbeyond.
OL,14,F"They asked me if there was anywhere
OL,15,Fyou could land a helicopter," she said.
